    "Total 60 as published. No Objective. The suffixes '-SL', '-SE' and '-SI' read as starting location / starting effect / starting interrupt: Yavin 4: Massassi Throne Room and Yavin 4: Docking Bay (both '-SL'), Insurrection ('Insurrection - SE') and The Signal ('The Signal - SI'); starting.card is the Throne Room (the strategy: 'I start out with the Throne Room').",
